.. sidebar:: ScenerySketching:: CodeAI
   :class: sidebar-ScenerySketching

   .. Zo'n 110 woorden -- komt terug in elke blog

   Engineers use tools.  But which ones?  Should we stick to our
   familiar, trusted gear, or embrace the "silver bullets" every AI
   provider promises?
   |BR|
   Or, can we mix and match?

   Mastering a tool takes *forever*; learning every ‘CodeAI’ tool takes
   even longer.  Unlucky engineers spend more time selecting genAI tools
   than those tools can ever make up for -- particularly, as you have to
   deliver high-quality, long-lasting software for HighTech embedded
   systems.
   |BR|
   Although CodeAI can assist.

   In this :ref:`series <ScenerySketching_CodeAI>`, I sketch the scenery as a Holistic Architectural
   Leader; skipping constantly changing details to boost that
   ‘golden’ controlled approach to rocket speed.
   |BR|
   Remember: As an engineer, you’re able to fill in the details, I
   only highlight the interfaces.
